  <summary>The local-first open-source Workspace for people and teams</summary>
  <description>
    <p>The local-first open-source Workspace for people and teams. Our mission is to give our users the perfect balance of simplicity, privacy, and productivity. Made with love ❤️ in 🇪🇺!</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>End-to-end encryption for complete privacy</li>
      <li>Markdown support for rich text formatting</li>
      <li>Sync across your devices</li>
      <li>Tags and folders for organization</li>
      <li>Export to various formats</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
